// What Protobuf says to the symbol index: the package is the namespace of the whole file, a
// message, enum or service is a type, a name is looked up in every enclosing scope up to the
// package and the root, and an import names a file. Format: core_semantics::symbols::rows.
separator .
absolute .
lexical
packages import-paths buf.yaml

Package namespace file name=FullIdent
Import file-import names=String modifiers=Keyword
Message type message name=MessageName
Enum type enum name=EnumName
Service type service name=ServiceName
MessageBody transparent
EnumBody transparent
Oneof transparent
Field property name=Ident refs=type:Type
OneofField property name=Ident refs=type:Type
MapField property name=Ident refs=Type
Group type message name=MessageName
FullIdent reference
EnumField case name=Ident
Rpc method name=RpcName refs=MessageType
Syntax ignore
Edition ignore
OptionDecl ignore
Reserved ignore
Extensions ignore
EmptyStatement ignore
Extend global-const item=Field name=Ident
